<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy – Kalenda</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --sage:    #4A7C59;
      --sage-lt: #EFF5F1;
      --ink:     #1C2B1E;
      --muted:   #5A6B5C;
      --border:  #D6E4D9;
      --bg:      #F8FAF8;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    header {
      background: var(--sage);
      padding: 3rem 2rem 2.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header .wordmark {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    header p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3rem 2rem 5rem;
    }

    .effective {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--sage-lt);
      color: var(--sage);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #2e3d30; }

    ul {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
      color: #2e3d30;
    }

    ul li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }

    a { color: var(--sage); text-decoration: underline; }

    .contact-box {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      background: var(--sage-lt);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .contact-box h2 {
      border: none;
      margin-top: 0;
      padding: 0;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wordmark">Kalenda</div>
  <p>Family Organizer</p>
</header>

<main>
  <span class="effective">Effective date: May 30, 2026</span>

  <p>Kalenda ("we," "our," or "us") is a family organizer app designed to help families coordinate schedules, share photos, and stay connected. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use the Kalenda mobile application.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We collect the following types of information to provide and improve our service:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account information</strong> — name and email address when you register</li>
    <li><strong>Family member information</strong> — names and profiles of family members you add, including children</li>
    <li><strong>Calendar and events data</strong> — events, reminders, and schedules you create or share</li>
    <li><strong>Photos and videos</strong> — media you upload to shared family albums</li>
    <li><strong>Device location</strong> — only when you explicitly use location-based features</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide, operate, and maintain the Kalenda app</li>
    <li>Sync your family's calendars, events, and photos across devices</li>
    <li>Send notifications and reminders for upcoming events</li>
    <li>Respond to support requests</li>
    <li>Improve app performance and user experience</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

  <h2>3. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Kalenda is designed for family use and may contain information about children under the age of 13. We collect this information solely to provide the family organizer service at the direction of a parent or guardian. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children independently, and children's profiles are always created and managed by a parent or guardian account.</p>
  <p>If you believe we have inadvertently collected information about a child without parental consent, please contact us immediately and we will delete it.</p>

  <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
  <p>Your data is stored securely on Google Cloud infrastructure. We implement industry-standard security measures including encrypted data transmission (HTTPS) and access controls to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.</p>

  <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not share your personal information with third parties except:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google Cloud</strong> — our infrastructure provider for hosting and storage</li>
    <li><strong>Legal requirements</strong> — if required by law, court order, or government authority</li>
    <li><strong>Safety</strong> — to protect the rights, property, or safety of Kalenda, our users, or the public</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access and download the personal data we hold about you</li>
    <li>Correct inaccurate information in your account</li>
    <li>Delete your account and associated data</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent for optional data processing at any time</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the address below.</p>

  <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active. When you delete your account, we will delete your personal data within 30 days, except where retention is required by law.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes by posting the new policy in the app or via email. Continued use of Kalenda after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

  <div class="contact-box">
    <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us:</p>
    <p>
      <strong>Kalenda</strong><br>
      Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@app.kalenda.com">privacy@app.kalenda.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  &copy; 2026 Kalenda. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
